fectiveness of their UNMT approach through extensive experiments on several languages with limited resources, including languages with small or non-existent datasets. The results show that UNMT achieves state-of-the-art performance on a range of translation tasks, including sentence-level and phrase-level translation, and demonstrates a significant improvement in translation quality compared to traditional NMT approaches"), mdx("h5", {
